abstract: "A conceptual AI Foundations repository proposing a specific coordinate at which possibility of consciousness and possibility of mattering are simultaneously present. The two possibilities are not treated as identical or sequential, and neither is assigned causal or temporal priority over the other. The repository distinguishes this core conceptual claim from unresolved hypotheses about persistence, transfer, recurrence, reset, binding, and any consciousness signal independent of a receiver."

